WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.780
"Had we but world enough,
and time, This coyness,

2
00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:08.230
Lady, were no crime" A
scroll unrolls a timeline,

3
00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:12.180
from ten years before the Flood,
to the conversion of the Jews.

4
00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:14.400
Beside it stands an hourglass.

5
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.070
Its sand has just begun to run.

6
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.520
He'd happily court her for centuries.

7
00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.760
So why won't he wait at all?

8
00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:25.270
In this mission, you'll break
his argument into three steps:

9
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.880
if, but, and therefore.

10
00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:31.580
You'll weigh up his over-the-top
praise: a hundred years,

11
00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.350
just for her eyes.

12
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.890
And you'll hear something
coming up at his back.

13
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.120
What is it?

14
00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.610
Your mission: explain
why he won't wait at all.
